. program define tab_open
  1.     args file
  2.     capture postclose TABH
  3.     postfile TABH str10 vintage str8 item str64 spec str80 sample str40 term double(b se p ci95_lo ci95_hi ci90_lo ci90_hi N N_full n_singletons n_separated n_clusters) ///
>         str20 cluster_var str244 note using "`file'", replace
  4. end

